sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Res as Research
    participant Tr as Training
    participant Ev as Evaluation and safety
    participant Inf as Inference platform
    participant P as Product
    Res->>Tr: architecture and data decisions
    Tr->>Tr: pretrain, then fine-tune, then preference training
    Tr->>Ev: candidate model
    Ev->>Ev: capability and safety evaluations
    alt passes
        Ev->>Inf: release the weights to serving
    else fails
        Ev->>Tr: back for more work
    end
    Inf->>P: served behind the API and the apps
    P-->>Res: real usage informs the next round
    Note over Ev,Inf: the evaluation gate is the part that distinguishes this from a research demo
